@profork 
Hi! Yes, flatpak apps can be run in runimage. The error on this screenshot is probably related to the need to isolate the PID namespace. In runimage, this is the option `RIM_UNSHARE_PIDS=1`. It also happens that some flatpak applications require isolation of /etc/resolv.conf (`RIM_UNSHARE_RESOLVCONF=1`) to run.

Try this and tell me if the problem has been solved.
